# An allow-list. The web image needs the workspace manifests and the web app,
# and nothing else: not the Go or Python services, not the docs, and above all
# not .env, which holds keys that must never be baked into a layer.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/web

apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/.env
apps/web/.env.*
